1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,999
JULIANA: Alexander!

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,400
ALEXANDER: It is nothing.

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,850
JULIANA: There is blood running down your arm.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,700
ALEXANDER: A cut from the tenant fields.

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,400
JULIANA: Sit down.

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,700
JULIANA: Now.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,300
JULIANA: I need to see the wound.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,300
ALEXANDER: It is only a scratch.

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,400
JULIANA: Then removing your shirt should not trouble you.

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,300
JULIANA: Dear God.
